{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "prometheus",
      "description": "",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "inventory-service, the platform's sole stock authority. Reservation FSM outcomes, availability checks, gRPC RED, and DB latency. Reads inventory:* recording rules where available. Landed at RFC-0021 phase 1; live since phase 4 with three callers -- the order saga, checkout, and product /details.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read this panel before the flat lines",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**inventory-service is the sole stock authority and has three live callers** since RFC-0021 phase 4: the order saga (reserve/commit/release), checkout (availability), and product `/details`. gRPC-only -- no Kong route -- so `:8080` carries only `/health` and `/ready` and every panel here reads the rpc_* RED metrics.\n\nA flat rate is therefore a **finding**, not the expected phase-1 reading it used to be. On a freshly rebuilt cluster it just means no traffic has run yet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Reservation FSM — stock authority",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reservation outcomes by operation",
      "description": "inventory_reservation_total by operation (reserve|release|commit) and outcome. Business outcomes (insufficient/conflict/concurrency/invalid_transition/not_found) and infra error share this counter — outcome=error drives the InventoryReservationInfraErrors alert.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "inventory:reservation:rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Availability check outcomes",
      "description": "inventory_check_total by outcome. fulfillable|shortage are business answers; unknown_sku (0.4.0+) is a DATA gap -- a SKU with no balance row in any warehouse, which checkout fails closed on (503) rather than presenting as out-of-stock; error is infra. unknown_sku outranks shortage when both are present, so a rising unknown_sku line with a falling shortage line is the same baskets being classified correctly, not a change in demand.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "inventory:check:rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "gRPC RED — InventoryService",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "gRPC request rate by method",
      "description": "otelgrpc server call rate, inventory.v1.InventoryService/*. Callers are live since phase 4, so a flat line means no traffic, not no wiring.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{app=\"inventory\", rpc_method=~\"inventory.v1.InventoryService/.+\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "gRPC error ratio by method",
      "description": "inventory:rpc_error:ratio5m — non-OK / all. FailedPrecondition on shortage counts as non-OK; read alongside the reservation outcomes panel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "inventory:rpc_error:ratio5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "gRPC p95 by method",
      "description": "inventory:rpc_duration:p95_5m — otelgrpc server histogram p95.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "inventory:rpc_duration:p95_5m",
          "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Database (product-db via PgDog)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DB query p95",
      "description": "inventory:db_operation_duration:p95_5m — otelpgx statement latency (pgx_operation_type=query).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "inventory:db_operation_duration:p95_5m",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "rfc-0021",
    "inventory"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
